## Loop Engineering (LoopKit)
For every non-trivial task (feature, bug, refactor, deploy, test, design), follow `.loop/LOOP.md`.
Read the spine in `.loop/` first, work in Goal -> Action -> Observe -> Adjust iterations, persist
state every iteration, and finish with the Handoff Report. Use `/loop` to start a task.
<!-- loopkit:end -->
